---
description: Scene components — animation only, no copy
globs: src/scenes/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- Scenes consume typed data from `src/content/`; no hard-coded Bulgarian strings.
- Clean up GSAP with `useGSAP` or explicit `ScrollTrigger.kill()` on unmount.
- Every scene must render a readable static layout when JS fails or `prefers-reduced-motion` is set.
